2. In this Order —
“floor area” has the meaning given by the Planning (Development) Rules 2008 (G.N. No. S 113/2008);
“specified area” means the area delineated in the map set out in the First Schedule;
“specified rate” means a rate specified in the second column of the Second Schedule;
“Use Group” means a Use Group specified in the first column of the Second Schedule.
